    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d10-a2">

                <pb facs="0092" n="1052" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1052"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thayer to Governor Hill.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mayor’s Office</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buffalo, N.
                                Y.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1888-03-26"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 26,
                    1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I am directed by his honor Mayor
                    Becker to transmit the inclosed report from the superintendent of police as an
                    answer to your esteemed inquiry of the 17th instant, inclosing a letter from the
                    consul-general of Italy in relation to recent arrests of Italians in
                    Buffalo.</p>
                <p>The mayor hopes that the explanation will be satisfactory, and bids me excuse the
                    delay in answering by saying that the principal facts have been duly
                    verified.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, very respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry S. Thayer</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
